<title>USA: Staff Builders Inc Q4 shr $0.04 vs $0.04.</title>
<headline>Staff Builders Inc Q4 shr $0.04 vs $0.04.</headline>
<dateline>LAKE SUCCESS, N.Y. 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months Ended    Fiscal Year Ended</p>
<p>				  February 28/29,	February 28/29,</p>
<p>				 1997	 1996	 1997	 1996</p>
<p>Revenues		$ 128,803  $ 105,394  $ 480,355  $ 410,160</p>
<p>Total costs and exp   127,180    103,777    473,639 406,687</p>
<p>Income before</p>
<p>  Income Taxes	  1,623	1,617	6,716	3,473</p>
<p>Provision for</p>
<p>  Income Taxes	   714	  679	2,955	1,459</p>
<p>Net Income	    $     909  $     938  $   3,761   $  2,014</p>
<p>Weighted average number of common and common</p>
<p>equivalent shares:</p>
<p>Primary		    24,195     24,358     24,591     25,340</p>
<p>Fully diluted	    24,451     24,451     24,648     25,532</p>
<p>Income per common and common equivalent share:</p>
<p>Primary		    $  .04     $  .04     $  .16     $  .08</p>
<p>Fully diluted	    $  .04     $  .04     $  .16     $  .08</p>
<p>			     (in thousands, except per share data)</p>
<p>NOTE: Growth from acquisitions resulted in 33 new locations and added $24.6 million in revenues during fiscal 1997.  The remaining increase in revenues of $45.6 million is a combination of internal growth of $26.6 million, or 7% plus $19.0 million related to new locations opened during fiscal 1997 or acquisitions during fiscal 1996 that were included for the full fiscal 1997 period.</p>
<p>Acquisitions by the ATC Staffing Division added $9.2 million in revenues for fiscal 1997 and increased divisional annual revenue by 39.3 percent to $42.8 million from $30.7 million in the prior year.</p>
</text>
